{"id":8776,"date":"2024-06-09T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-06-09T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8776"},"modified":"2026-05-27T09:47:52","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T09:47:52","slug":"custom-home-design-tips-for-beginners","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/custom-home-design-tips-for-beginners\/","title":{"rendered":"Custom Home Design Tips for Beginners"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>You&#8217;ve been dreaming about building your own dream house since you were a kid, and now it&#8217;s finally time to start planning! Custom homes are perfect for those who love design and architecture, and they are also great for families needing space to grow. However, before you begin construction, there are several crucial things to consider to ensure a smooth and successful project. Here are some essential tips for beginners looking to design their custom home. Remember, the most important step is <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">finding the right help<\/a> to make your dreams come true, and that&#8217;s where expert guidance can make all the difference.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/53910-sofa-and-armchairs-in-modern-house-2023-11-27-05-28-45-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Sitting area of a home\" class=\"wp-image-8779\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Start with a Budget<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before you even think about buying land or hiring an architect, you need to decide how much money you want to spend on your custom home. Establishing a budget is the foundation of your custom home project. It will help you determine what features you want and whether you can afford them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Budgeting Tips for Custom Homes<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Assess Your Finances<\/strong>: Evaluate your savings, income, and existing debts. Determine how much you can comfortably spend without jeopardizing your financial stability.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Consider Financing Options<\/strong>: Look into mortgage options specifically designed for custom homes. Consult with financial advisors to understand the best loan products available.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Include All Costs<\/strong>: When budgeting, include costs such as land purchase, architectural fees, permits, construction, landscaping, and interior design.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Set a Contingency Fund<\/strong>: Always allocate an extra 10-15% of your budget for unexpected expenses. Custom home projects often encounter unforeseen costs.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For example, building a custom home in areas like Happy Valley, OR, Gresham, OR, Portland, OR might have different costs due to local regulations and land prices. Be sure to research these factors thoroughly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Decide Where You Want to Build<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Choosing the right location for your custom home is crucial. The location affects your lifestyle, commute, school district, and even the resale value of your home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Factors to Consider When Choosing a Location<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Community<\/strong>: Do you want to live in a quiet, rural area like Happy Valley, OR or a bustling suburb like Beaverton, OR? Each option has its pros and cons. Rural areas offer more privacy and space, while suburban areas provide better access to amenities and services.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Proximity to Work and Schools<\/strong>: Consider the daily commute to work and the distance to good schools if you have children.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Amenities<\/strong>: Look for nearby amenities such as parks, shopping centers, medical facilities, and recreational activities.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Zoning Laws<\/strong>: Check the zoning regulations in the area to ensure you can build the type of home you want.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For instance, Portland, OR offers a blend of suburban charm and easy access to city amenities, making it a popular choice for custom homes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/the-project-architect-s-back-is-on-the-constructio-2023-11-27-05-17-04-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"A home contractor working on the site\" class=\"wp-image-8780\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get a Builder<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hiring a competent and reliable builder is one of the most important decisions you will make in the custom home-building process. A good builder will oversee the entire project, ensuring everything runs smoothly from start to finish.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Right Builder<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research and Recommendations<\/strong>: Ask for recommendations from friends, family, and local real estate agents. Look for builders with positive reviews and a strong reputation.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Experience<\/strong>: Choose a builder with experience in constructing custom homes similar to what you envision. This is crucial for ensuring quality and adherence to your design preferences.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Licensing and Insurance<\/strong>: Ensure the builder is properly licensed and insured to protect yourself from liabilities.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Portfolio and References<\/strong>: Review the builder\u2019s portfolio of past projects and ask for references. Visiting previous homes they\u2019ve built can provide insight into their craftsmanship and style.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In regions like Happy Valley, OR, and Hillsboro, OR, where the housing market is dynamic, finding a reputable builder is essential for a successful custom home project. This is where <a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> excels. With our extensive experience and dedication to quality, we specialize in bringing your custom home dreams to life.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Decide on a Style<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your custom home should reflect your personal taste and lifestyle. Deciding on a style early in the process helps streamline the design phase and ensures that all elements of the home are cohesive.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Popular Custom Home Styles<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Traditional<\/strong>: Known for their classic and timeless appeal, traditional homes often feature gabled roofs, brick or wood exteriors, and detailed woodwork. They are usually more affordable and require less maintenance.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Modern<\/strong>: Modern homes are characterized by clean lines, open floor plans, and extensive use of glass to create light-filled spaces. They often incorporate sustainable materials and innovative technologies.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Farmhouse<\/strong>: Combining rustic charm with modern amenities, farmhouse-style homes feature large porches, open kitchens, and spacious living areas. They are ideal for families looking for a cozy, welcoming atmosphere.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Craftsman<\/strong>: Emphasizing handcrafted details, craftsman homes showcase exposed beams, built-in furniture, and extensive woodwork. They blend functionality with artistic elements.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/modern-luxury-house-and-garden-2023-11-27-05-17-02-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"A look to the big beautiful house\" class=\"wp-image-8782\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tips for Choosing a Style<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Consider Your Lifestyle<\/strong>: Think about how you live and what home features are most important to you. For example, if you entertain frequently, an open floor plan with a large kitchen and dining area might be ideal.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Climate and Environment<\/strong>: Choose a style that suits the climate and landscape of your chosen location. For instance, homes in Tigard, OR should be designed to withstand the region&#8217;s wet climate.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Future Needs<\/strong>: Plan for the future by considering potential family growth, aging in place, and resale value.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Designing a custom home is an exciting journey that allows you to create a space tailored to your unique needs and preferences. However, this process can be complex and challenging, requiring meticulous planning and execution to bring your vision to life. Starting with a clear budget, selecting the right location, and choosing a reputable builder are crucial steps in ensuring a successful custom home-building experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Given the significant investment involved, it is essential to plan thoroughly and make informed decisions. In regions like Tigard, OR, and <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/best-construction-services-in-gresham\/\">Gresham, OR<\/a>, where the housing market is dynamic, navigating the custom home design process can be particularly demanding. At <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/services\/\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a>, we specialize in transforming your dream home concepts into reality with professionalism and precision. Let us handle the complexities and ensure that your custom home project is completed to the highest standards. Happy designing!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>You&#8217;ve been dreaming about building your own dream house since you were a kid, and now it&#8217;s finally time to start planning! Custom homes are perfect for those who love design and architecture, and they are also great for families needing space to grow. However, before you begin construction, there are several crucial things to [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8778,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[33,34,30,32],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-8776","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-remodeling-tips","category-addition-resources","category-bathroom-resources","category-kitchen-resources"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8776","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8776"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8776\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16324,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8776\/revisions\/16324"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8776"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8776"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8776"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}